  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十一关（前）\n8:36 P.M. \\ Rainy \\ Visibility: 12 km\nRhodes Island"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "Welcome back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...Mm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "I already heard what happened from the recon squad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "Amiya, let me check your hands."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "There's no need for that, Dr. Kal'tsit..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "Amiya."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "I, I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...All right."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "It looks fine. The rings haven't cracked or discolored."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "But it might be different next time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "Listen closely, Amiya..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "Be a little more careful."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit, I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...I need some rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Mm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "Never put Amiya in this much risk again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "You are also responsible for what happened."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "When you first came back to Rhodes Island, she looked a bit like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "These emotions never really left Amiya."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "This has to change."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "...Dr. {@nickname}, you should stay with her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "Don't mess up."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "*knock* *knock*",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "It's open."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Dr. {@nickname}...?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Worried? I am?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#10",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "...You saw right through me, hehe..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I thought I did a good job hiding it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Yes, I'm a bit worried... just a little, though."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I'm already used to doing this."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "After all, I can't drag down everyone else any more."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Right, Doctor?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "...I don't understand."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Doctor... I don't understand."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "(Stay silent)",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "No, I... I know what we're trying to do. I also know... that some sacrifices are inevitable."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "But I... what I don't know is..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Why must I watch people disappear before my eyes one by one... even though they can be saved?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "We were so close... Maybe just a little bit more..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I know that I have a duty... and I will continue to move forward..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "But right now... I just feel so tired."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "..."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "...",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Amiya...",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Please let me have some time alone, Dr. {@nickname}."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Thank you."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Good morning, Dr. {@nickname}."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Oh, Dr. Kal'tsit, you're here as well?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Amiya."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "I have a rather urgent mission here, and need some people to help out."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "An abandoned city was discovered not far from Lungmen."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "I surmise that it's one of the cities that formed in the aftermath of the Chernobog incident."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "We'll have to explore that city, uncover more information, and search for any survivors."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "If the situation is particularly serious, for example, if Reunion is hiding there, then there may be serious ramifications on our future operations."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Here's the specific proposal that I have in mind. Look over it when you have time."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Understood."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Oh, one more thing."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Franka submitted a report to me mentioning that they had to return to Blacksteel."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "As for the situation in the Lungmen slums, Penguin Logistics requested for you to meet them there to discuss some information."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "There are some more sensitive details, so it'd be best for you to go in person."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I know. I'll head over right now."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Doctor, let's go--"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "I still have some things to discuss with Dr. {@nickname}."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "May I listen in?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "You may not."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I can cover my ears..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "You cannot. You should get going."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Aww..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit, you're not allowed to bully Dr. {@nickname}."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "I won't."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "...You..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "You couldn't even do something so basic."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Forget it, I had a feeling this would happen."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Amiya is an incredibly resilient kid."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "But, if she has to force herself to be strong, there will come a day when the pressure breaks her."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Do not let this happen."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "If there is a next time, you'd better be a little more useful."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "--?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "What's with that face?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Excuse me, but what do you mean by Amiya's rings...?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "It's related to the state of her health."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "If Amiya is involved in an intense battle..."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "...You must check her rings immediately afterwards."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "No matter what changes you see, you must report them to me."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "For the time being, that's all you're allowed to know."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "Oh, right. You have to go down to the medical center in two days to have a physical done. Don't forget it."
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "...You can go. Liskarm is waiting outside to escort you."
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            }
          ]
        },
